# The unit of work variation point attaches to the PostgreSQL example: it adds
# the unit of work over the database (the router of its connections in
# src/todo/infrastructure/postgres/unit_of_work), the command middleware that
# ends it, and the sample command ImportItems with its scenarios, and changes
# only these files: the composition root, which attaches the unit and lists the
# middleware, the command registry, which builds ImportItems over the decorated
# AddItem, and the readme.
base library/architecture/python/vp-postgres-in-python.skill/examples
change src/todo/main.py
change src/todo/command/handlers.py
change README.md
